# The mihomo whose convert-ruleset compiles the rules branch's .mrs rule sets: an OpenWeir
# mihomo release by tag, then for each platform the release's archive and its SHA-256. The
# rules workflow downloads its runner's archive from this tag and refuses any other bytes.
# docs/rules.md ("Bumping mihomo") says how to move it; go test ./cmd/rules checks its form.
